## OCR 后端选择（手写，非 .ts 转换产物）

ocr-backend-system = System OCR

ocr-backend-local-model = Local model

ocr-backend-system-not-implemented = System OCR is not available yet. The local model is used instead.

ocr-backend-system-no-language-pack = System OCR needs an OCR language pack for your Windows languages. Add one in Windows language settings. The local model is used instead.

ocr-backend-system-engine-failed = System OCR could not start. The local model is used instead.
